3	//! The engine→CN result interchange is the Arrow C Data Interface (see the `SiriusExecutor`
4	//! TODO). Today a [`StubExecutor`] stands in for the GPU engine so the StarRocks dispatch and
5	//! result-return plumbing can be exercised end to end without a build tree or a GPU.
