649	    /// onceTalkTimeout — neither raisable from SQL). A pin that materializes longer keeps
650	    /// running here to completion after the FE reports failure, with no cancel path, and a
651	    /// retry queues a second full materialization behind it. Operators must size pins under
652	    /// the ceiling (pin only queried columns / one pin per table) and watch the CN log's
653	    /// `pin_table finished` line rather than retry on timeout.
